                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is supposed to be a lane defense a la Plants vs. Zombies, except without plants. It has some promise, but it just feels very unfinished. The stage labeled as \"tutorial\" doesn't really explain anything beyond the very basic \"how to place tower\" and \"what mouse button to use\". After that, it's a wild guessing game what towers do or what enemies are vulnurable to. There is no menu, no pause, no back to level select, no nothing. That's just too barebones to recommend it.",
